WEBVTT

00:06:27.792 --> 00:06:30.101
weigh in and advocate

00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:34.375
even when it seems like the issue
has nothing to do with us.

00:06:35.125 --> 00:06:36.434
And actually,

00:06:36.458 --> 00:06:39.684
those are the issues
that are most compelling.

00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:41.208
And sure,

00:06:41.917 --> 00:06:46.018
people will have no idea
why you are there,

00:06:46.042 --> 00:06:49.351
but that's why those of us
facing injustice

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:52.268
must be willing to accept the help.

00:06:52.292 --> 00:06:55.226
You know, we have to fight injustice

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.542
with a consciousness of grace.

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:01.226
When white guys stand up to fight